  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4609.07 Approval Process for Initial Certifications and Recertifications",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-03-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4609.07 Approval Process for Initial Certifications and Recertifications.\n\n(a) Subject to (b), below, the requirements of Env-A 4609.08 through Env-A 4609.15 shall apply to both initial certification and recertification of a monitoring system installed in accordance with Env-A 4609.02(a).\n\n(b) For recertifications, the following shall apply:\n\n(1) The words “certification” and “initial certification” shall be read as “recertification”;\n\n(2) The word “certified” shall be read as “recertified”; and\n\n(3) The process described in 40 CFR 75.20(b)(5) and (g)(7) shall be used in lieu of Env-A 4609.12.\n\nSource. #9283, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9444, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14; ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4600.html"
